  "title": "Replay Reuse and Distinct Critic Evaluations",
  "introduction": "In this illustrative snapshot, replay already contains $\\tau_O=(s_O,a_O,r_O,s'_O)$ and later receives $\\tau_N=(s_N,a_N,r_N,s'_N)$. We condition on $\\tau_O$ still being available when an update selects it; the paper does not specify insertion or eviction behavior. SAC then separates the stored action used for critic regression from a fresh current-policy action used for actor improvement.",
