    {
      "title": "Regress both critics at the stored action",
      "explanation": "The target value network evaluates the observed next state, producing $V_{\\bar\\psi}(s'_O)$, and the stored reward forms $y=r_O+\\gamma V_{\\bar\\psi}(s'_O)$. Both independently trained critics receive the unchanged replay pair $(s_O,a_O)$ and regress toward $y$, yielding $Q_{\\theta_1}(s_O,a_O)$ and $Q_{\\theta_2}(s_O,a_O)$.",
